# EPDS — Molecules Catalog

## Cards, Tiles, and Marketing Content

### `BrandShowcaseCard` — `src/components/BrandShowcaseCard/`
- **Figma**: "Card" — default node `7669:6028`, hover `7669:6031`, selected `7669:6034`. Designed for the Sonic Group **brand-portfolio organism** (one card per sub-brand: Sonic Automotive, EchoPark, Tactical Fleet, Powersports). Exactly one card in the group is selected/expanded at a time; the parent organism owns "exactly-one" group state.
- **Role**: Selectable photo card with three visual states. Brand-agnostic — every visual detail that varies per brand is a prop, so the same molecule renders any sub-brand without overrides. Brand-specific expanded-state body content is provided via the `#selected-content` slot.
- **Dimensions**: `width: 322px` collapsed → `width: 384px` selected, `height: 455px` constant. Width transitions via `transition: width 0.3s ease`.
- **Props** (all visual specifics defaulted to the Sonic Automotive Figma frame):
  - `name: string` (**required**)
  - `imageUrl: string` (**required** — full-bleed background photo)
  - `tagline?: string`
  - `logoLight: string` (**required**) + `logoLightHeight?: number` (default `83`)
  - `logoColor?: string` + `logoColorHeight?: number` (default `57`)
  - `description?: string`
  - `hoverScrimColor?: string` (default `'rgba(242, 73, 34, 0.7)'`)
  - `defaultScrimColor?: string` (default `'rgba(37, 45, 55, 0.7)'`)
  - `selectedScrimColor?: string` (default `'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)'`)
  - `ctaLabel?: string` — text for the bottom CTA (rendered as `BaseButton size="sm" variant="primary"`)
  - `selected?: boolean` (v-model)
  - `ariaLabel?: string`
- **Slots**:
  - `#selected-content` — brand-specific markup rendered between the description and the CTA in the expanded state.
  - `#cta` (scope: `{ onCtaClick: (event: MouseEvent) => void }`) — optional override slot for the entire CTA area. When this slot is present **and** `ctaLabel` is also set, the slot wins. CTA area is `flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center`.
- **Width CSS vars**: `--bsc-width-collapsed` (default `322px`) and `--bsc-width-selected` (default `384px`). The parent `BrandPortfolio` organism overrides them to `100%`.
- **Emits**: `update:selected: [boolean]` (only ever `true` — molecule never emits `false`), `select: [event: Event]`, `cta-click: [event: MouseEvent]`
- **Visual states**: Default (dark-navy scrim) · Hover (brand-colour scrim 70%) · Selected (white scrim 90% + colour logo + description + `BaseButton sm primary` CTA)
- **Click semantics**: Collapsed-state card root is `<div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false">`; selected-state root drops `role`, `tabindex`, and `aria-pressed`.
- **Co-located helpers** (story-only — not exported from `src/index.ts`):
  - **Sonic OEM grid (three small files)** — `SonicOemGrid.vue`, `SonicOemLogoCells.vue` (takes `cells: readonly SonicOemLogoCellData[]`), `SonicOemLogoCell.vue` (exports `SonicOemLogoCellData`).
  - `EchoParkLocationsGrid.vue` — EchoPark 3-column / 6-row city list. Default list is overridable via the `locations` prop.
  - `PowersportsLogoRow.vue` — Sonic Powersports 3-logo dealership row.
- **Stories**: `Default`, `Hover` (uses `pseudo` addon), `Selected`, `AllStates`, `Interactive`. Story scaffolding lives in `BrandShowcaseCard.stories.css`.
- **Storybook `title`**: `Molecules/BrandShowcaseCard`

