### `Pagination` — `src/components/Pagination/`
- **Figma**: "Pagination" — standard pagination control with arrow buttons and numbered pill
- **Props**: `totalPages: number` (**required**), `modelValue?: number` (default `1`, v-model)
- **Emits**: `update:modelValue: [page: number]`
- **Anatomy**: Left arrow + pill container (page numbers + ellipsis) + right arrow; 8px gap between arrow and pill
- **Arrow buttons**: 48×48px circles; states Default (white bg, 1px `--color-neutral-90` border) · Hover (`--color-accent-90`) · Pressed (#C8E0E9) · Focus (3px `--color-accessibility-80` border); hidden via `opacity: 0` when at first/last page
- **Number buttons**: 44×44px circles inside 48px pill (2px padding); Active = `--color-accent-40` bg + white bold
- **Pill**: 48px height, 2px padding, `border-radius: 46px`, 1px `--color-neutral-90` border, white bg
- **Ellipsis**: "..." in `--color-neutral-70`, shown when page gap exists
- **Page window algorithm**: ≤5 pages shows all; page 1–3 active: `[1,2,3,4,...,last]`; near end: `[1,...,n-3,n-2,n-1,n]`; middle: `[1,...,c-1,c,c+1,...,last]`
- **Mobile**: pill stretches (`flex: 1`) below 600px; pages spread with `justify-content: space-between`
- **Arrow icons**: `Style=Arrows, Detail=Tail, Icon=Left/Right.svg?raw` — scales to 26px on hover/pressed
- **Accessibility**: `<nav aria-label="Pagination">`, `aria-current="page"` on active number, `aria-label` on all buttons
- **Stories**: FirstPageActive, Pages2To3Active, MiddlePageActive, LastPageActive, Only2Pages, Only3Pages, Interactive, AllPagePositions, MobileWidth
- **Storybook `title`**: `Molecules/Pagination`

