## Status / Feedback

### `CompareTray` — `src/components/CompareTray/`
- **Figma**: nodes `13945:38154` (count + CTA) and `13945:38159` (prompt-only) — floating notification card that appears once the user flags a vehicle on an SRP tile.
- **Props**: `count: number` (**required**), `ctaThreshold?: number` (default `2`), `addMoreLabel?: string` (default `'Add more to compare'`), `selectedLabel?: string` (default `'vehicles selected'`), `compareLabel?: string` (default `'Compare'`), `ariaLabel?: string`
- **Emits**: `compare: [event: MouseEvent]`
- **Behaviour**:
  - `count === 0` → component renders nothing
  - `0 < count < ctaThreshold` → 85px card with **prompt** text only (`addMoreLabel`)
  - `count >= ctaThreshold` → 149px card showing `<count> {selectedLabel}` (count is bold, rest Light 300) plus a 148×56 `BaseButton variant="primary"` labelled `compareLabel`
- **Layout**:
  - **Desktop (≥600px)**: 412px fixed-width card, `position: fixed; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 900`, shadow falls up-and-left
  - **Mobile (<600px)**: stretches to 100vw, pinned to the bottom of the viewport, shadow straight up
- **Animation**: fade + slide-up on enter/leave (`transition: transform 0.25s ease, opacity 0.2s ease`). `@media (prefers-reduced-motion)` drops the transform.
- **Typography**: Prompt + count label share Roboto Light 22px, line-height 1.2, `--color-neutral-0`. The count number is `font-weight: 700`.
- **Brand awareness**: The CTA uses `BaseButton variant="primary"` so the filled background automatically themes brand colour.
- **Accessibility**: `<aside role="status" aria-live="polite">` so assistive tech announces state changes
- **Stories**: AddMorePrompt, TwoSelected, ThreeSelected, Hidden, Interactive, Mobile
- **Storybook `title`**: `Molecules/CompareTray`

