### `VdpSummary` — `src/components/VdpSummary/`
- **Figma**: node `13948:43443` ("Group 1631") — VDP above-the-fold right column.
- **Props**: `year?: number | string`, `make?: string`, `model: string` (**required**), `trim?: string`, `price?: number | string`, `priceLabel?: string` (default `'MSRP'`), `secondaryLabel?: string` (default `'See Store Price'`), `dealerName?: string`, `ctaLabel?: string` (default `'Test Drive'`), `vin?: string`, `stockNumber?: string`
