### `SrpFilterCondition` — `src/components/SrpFilterCondition/`
- **Figma**: Sonic SRP only — not present on EchoPark SRP because EchoPark only sells used vehicles
- **Role**: Multi-select checkbox filter letting Sonic shoppers narrow inventory by **New**, **Pre-owned**, **Certified pre-owned**
- **Props**: `options: ConditionOption[]` (**required**), `selected?: string[]`, `committed?: string[]`
- **Type export**: `ConditionOption` — `{ value: string, label: string, count: number }`
- **Emits**: `update:selected`
- **Composes**: `SrpFilterChild`
- **Key behaviour**: Committed selections float to top in the "returning" green style on re-open; no internal section headings
- **SrpPage integration**: `SrpPage` conditionally inserts a `condition` category only when `isSonic` is true, placed right after `distance`
- **Stories**: Default, NewSelected, MultipleSelected, AllSelected, Returning, Interactive
- **Storybook `title`**: `Molecules/SRP Filters/SrpFilterCondition`

### `SrpFilterVehicleStatus` — `src/components/SrpFilterVehicleStatus/`
- **Figma**: Sonic SRP only — not shown on the EchoPark SRP.
- **Role**: Multi-select checkbox filter letting Sonic shoppers narrow inventory by **On the lot** vs **In transit**
- **Props**: `options: VehicleStatusOption[]` (**required**), `selected?: string[]`, `committed?: string[]`
- **Type export**: `VehicleStatusOption` — `{ value: string, label: string, count: number }`
- **Emits**: `update:selected`
- **Composes**: `SrpFilterChild`
- **Key behaviour**: Structurally identical to `SrpFilterCondition` — committed selections float to the top in the "returning" green style on re-open
- **SrpPage integration**: Sonic-only. `SrpPage` splices both `vehicle-status` and `condition` into position 1 of the category list (right after `distance`) when `isSonic` is true, with **Vehicle status appearing directly above Condition**. `SrpPage` exposes `visibleListings` — a computed that filters `listings` by the `vehicleStatus` field when this filter is active (listings without an explicit status are treated as `'on-lot'`).
- **Stories**: Default, OnLotSelected, InTransitSelected, BothSelected, Returning, Interactive
- **Storybook `title`**: `Molecules/SRP Filters/SrpFilterVehicleStatus`

